sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Buyer as 客户（Buyer）

  box #E3F2FD Platform (Microsoft Commercial Marketplace)
    participant MP as 平台：Marketplace
    participant SF as 平台：SaaS Fulfillment API
  end

  box #E8F5E9 Your implementation (Publisher SaaS)
    participant LP as 你方：Landing Page
    participant SaaS as 你方：SaaS Backend
    participant DB as 你方：Subscription DB
  end

  Note over MP,SF: 平台侧（Marketplace 提供）
  Note over LP,DB: 你方实现侧（Publisher SaaS 要实现）

  Buyer->>MP: Purchase SaaS Offer/Plan
  MP->>LP: Redirect (marketplaceToken)
  LP->>SF: Resolve(marketplaceToken)
  SF-->>LP: subscriptionId, offerId, planId, purchaser info
  LP->>SaaS: Provision request (subscriptionId + customer inputs)
  SaaS->>DB: Upsert subscription mapping + status
  SaaS-->>LP: Provision result
  alt Auto activation
    LP->>SF: Activate(subscriptionId, planId)
    SF-->>LP: Activated
    LP-->>Buyer: Show success / enter app
  else Pending activation
    LP-->>Buyer: Show "Pending activation" + next steps
  end